  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* feat: add privacy by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1223\r\n* chore: add favicon by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1224\r\n* Add Swamp Swamp GUI link under desktop apps section by @Ferase in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1227\r\n* docs: add croc-desktop to unofficial desktop GUI list by @SihanTeng in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1207\r\n* build(deps): bump docker/login-action from 4.5.2 to 4.6.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1225\r\n* feat: use croc.schollz.com temporarily by @schollz in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1228\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @Ferase made their first contribution in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1227\r\n* @SihanTeng made their first contribution in https://github.com/schollz/croc/pull/1207\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/schollz/croc/compare/v11.0.1...v11.0.2",
